FUNCTION uleb 8 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 uleb 1 i32 ; Type 8: 8 i32 parameters, 1 i32 result.
FUNCTION uleb 9 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 uleb 1 i32 ; Type 9: 9 i32 parameters, 1 i32 result.
FUNCTION uleb 10 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 uleb 1 i32 ; Type 10: 10 i32 parameters, 1 i32 result.
FUNCTION uleb 11 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 uleb 1 i32 ; Type 11: 11 i32 parameters, 1 i32 result.
FUNCTION uleb 12 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 uleb 1 i32 ; Type 12: 12 i32 parameters, 1 i32 result.
FUNCTION uleb 13 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 uleb 1 i32 ; Type 13: 13 i32 parameters, 1 i32 result.
FUNCTION uleb 14 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 uleb 1 i32 ; Type 14: 14 i32 parameters, 1 i32 result.
FUNCTION uleb 15 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 uleb 1 i32 ; Type 15: 15 i32 parameters, 1 i32 result.
FUNCTION uleb 17 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 i32 uleb 1 i32 ; Type 16: 17 i32 parameters, 1 i32 result.
FUNCTION uleb 0  uleb 0 ; Type 17: 0 i32 parameters, 0 i32 result.
SECTION_END ; Finish signature table.
SECTION SECTION_IMPORT ; Python host functions become imports.
uleb 4 ; Four host imports.
uleb 3 str env uleb 9 str print_i32 FUNCTION_KIND uleb 0 ; Python host function print_i32; function index 0.
uleb 3 str env uleb 10 str print_char FUNCTION_KIND uleb 0 ; Python host function print_char; function index 1.
uleb 3 str env uleb 10 str write_char FUNCTION_KIND uleb 0 ; Python host function write_char; function index 2.
uleb 3 str env uleb 12 str exit_program FUNCTION_KIND uleb 0 ; Python host function exit_program; function index 3.
SECTION_END ; Finish imports.
SECTION SECTION_FUNCTION ; Declare the translated Python functions.
uleb 33 ; Count of translated functions.
#f_writeSectionChar 4 uleb 0 ; Python L67: writeSectionChar; function index 4.
#f_writeSection 5 uleb 1 ; Python L78: writeSection; function index 5.
